**To:** `/Users/synrtechs/Documents/Claude/Code-Projects/QMULATE`

This project was moved during a Documents reorganization to consolidate all Claude Code projects under `Documents/Claude/Code-Projects/`.

## Recovering Claude Code session memory

Claude Code stores session memory keyed by the old absolute path. If you want prior context:
```
~/.claude/projects/
```
Look for a folder matching the old path hash. The project code and git history are fully intact.
